# Platform-Agnostic Standards

- Remain compatible with: Vercel, Railway, Supabase, Neon, UpCloud, xPanel-like platforms.
- Environment-driven configuration. No hardcoded secrets.
- Stateless runtime where possible. Externalized storage where needed.
- Migration-aware database changes.
- Avoid provider lock-in unless explicitly approved.
- Keep deployment assumptions documented.
